stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> Committed
    Committed --> Pending : claim, stage or retire
    Pending --> Committed : rename to commit
    Pending --> Retained : interrupted before rename
    Retained --> Committed : validated recovery

    [*] --> FirstSnapshot
    FirstSnapshot --> PublisherObserved : verify live publisher
    FirstSnapshot --> MissingClaim : no committed claim
    FirstSnapshot --> Unverified : observation failed
    PublisherObserved --> SecondSnapshot : reopen committed file
    SecondSnapshot --> Allowed : same claim and live process
    SecondSnapshot --> Unverified : changed or unverified

    class Pending wait
    class Allowed ok
    class Unverified fail
